# Folder overrides for the audio lab container. Copy to `.env` (next to
# docker-compose.yml) only if your media does not live in the repository.
#
# The defaults point at ./songs, ./gptabs and ./.stems, which is right when you
# run from a clone. Set these to match whatever you chose in the app's Settings
# screen — the container needs to see the same folders the app writes to.
#
# Use forward slashes on Windows: SONGS_DIR=D:/Music/practice

# SONGS_DIR=./songs
# GPTABS_DIR=./gptabs
# STEMS_DIR=./.stems
